<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 7.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			    Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Villa World	     10.58    1.04</p>
<p> 2 McIntosh Sec	    10.34    0.87</p>
<p> 3 Prime Credit Tr	 10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 4 Indu Property	   10.11    0.90</p>
<p> 5 Prop Income Inv	 10.06    1.01</p>
<p> 6 BT Prop Trust	    9.49    1.72</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.20    1.15</p>
<p> 8 Central Equity	   8.91    1.01</p>
<p> 9 Centro Prop		8.86    2.20</p>
<p>10 Aust Tour		  8.82    0.85</p>
<p>11 Equitilink		 8.77    0.57</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.76    0.89</p>
<p>13 Armstrong Retail	 8.68    0.76</p>
<p>14 Advance Pro CB	   8.47    1.37</p>
<p>15 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.47    1.60</p>
